<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thanks for making contact about your call to our Contact Centre.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We believe a great journey starts with a great booking experience, so I was very concerned to read your feedback, advising us of the incorrect information you received from our consultant.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">You have every right to expect skilled and capable service from all of our team, so I commenced an investigation with Contact Centre Management as soon as we received your report. We have listened to the phone call on <b>-<i>DATE-</i></b> and I can confirm you were advised <b>-<i>details of call-</i>.</b></font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We’re committed to giving you the best service and advice so are grateful you took the time to let us know about this. I hope that you will give us the opportunity to welcome you on board again soon.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
